{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Bound Methods"}], "prev": {"link": "../Message.edit_caption/", "title": "Message.edit_caption()"}, "next": {"link": "../Message.edit_reply_markup/", "title": "Message.edit_reply_markup()"}, "title": "Message.edit_media()", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"message-edit-media\">\n<h1>Message.edit_media()<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#message-edit-media\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.Message.edit_media\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">Message.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">edit_media</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.Message.edit_media\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bound method <em>edit_media</em> of <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/Message/#pyrogram.types.Message\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Message\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Message</span></code></a>.</p>\n<p>Use as a shortcut for:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">await</span> <span class=\"n\">client</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">edit_message_media</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">chat_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">message</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">chat</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">message_id</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">message</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">id</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">media</span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"n\">media</span>\n<span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Example</p>\n<div class=\"highlight-python notranslate\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">await</span> <span class=\"n\">message</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">edit_media</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">media</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>media</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/InputMedia/#pyrogram.types.InputMedia\" title=\"pyrogram.types.InputMedia\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InputMedia</span></code></a>) \u2013 One of the InputMedia objects describing an animation, audio, document, photo or video.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>reply_markup</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/InlineKeyboardMarkup/#pyrogram.types.InlineKeyboardMarkup\" title=\"pyrogram.types.InlineKeyboardMarkup\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">InlineKeyboardMarkup</span></code></a>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 An InlineKeyboardMarkup object.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>file_name</strong> (<code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></code>, <em>optional</em>) \u2013 File name of the media to be sent. Not applicable to photos.\nDefaults to file\u2019s path basename.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>On success, the edited <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../types/Message/#pyrogram.types.Message\" title=\"pyrogram.types.Message\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Message</span></code></a> is returned.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>RPCError</strong> \u2013 In case of a Telegram RPC error.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/bound-methods/Message.edit_reply_markup", "Message.edit_reply_markup()", "N", "next"], ["api/bound-methods/Message.edit_caption", "Message.edit_caption()", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Message.edit_media()</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.Message.edit_media\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">Message.edit_media()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "api/bound-methods/Message.edit_media", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}